input.prompt:
Summarize the following in-product user feedback from the last 7 days for a product management team. It contains {{ result('fetch_feedback').records | length }} entries.

{% for r in result('fetch_feedback').records %}
- App: {{ r.appName }} {{ r.appVersion }} | Feature: {{ r.feedbackType }} | Rating: {{ r.thumbs | default('none', true) }} | Feedback: {{ r.feedback | default('(no text)', true) }}
{% endfor %}

What are the main issues, what is positive, and which entries should the product team look at first? Answer in Slack mrkdwn (single *asterisks* for bold, "•" for bullets, no # headings, no tables), under 300 words, with the sections *Summary*, *Top issues*, *Positive feedback* and *Worth a look*.
